Experimental PHP 7.0.33 adaptation of Canonical's legacy security patch.
Preserves the vendor hard-OOM and session-progress policy. PHP 7.0 state
owners are reset after its own shutdown sequence. Regenerate VM sources.
Source and original attribution: patches/php-7.2/canonical-CVE-2026-109618_109619.patch.
Original authors: Arnaud Le Blanc and Ilija Tovilo.
String-size prerequisite definitions follow Canonical's CVE-2017-9118 patches.

